                "text": "This verifier needs objects whose color is unique among all objects in the grid, with the output being just that object cropped out and isolated. I'm planning to design grids with many same-colored boxes plus one differently-colored box, then produce crops showing only that unique object's cells.\n\nSketching out grid A with two diamond shapes made of color 8 plus a hollow 5x5 square of color 3, giving a clean 5x5 output. For grid B, I'm thinking of using multiple hollow squares of one color plus a distinct rectangle of another color as the unique object.\n\nFor grid C, I'm sketching a hollow 4x4 square of color 5 in the top rows and two diamond patterns of color 2 branching out below, keeping it within an 11x11 layout.\n\n",
                "type": "reasoning_text"
              }
            ],
